     </session-factory>
   </hibernate-configuration>
   ```

   In this example, we set up the HikariCP connection pool provider and configure its properties, such as minimum idle connections, maximum pool size, and idle timeout.

3. Use the session factory to obtain sessions: Once the connection pool is configured, use the session factory to obtain sessions. Hibernate will automatically retrieve connections from the pool and return them when the session is closed. For example:

   ```
